# Bootable message catalog: English (source of truth and fallback).
#
# Format: `key = value`, one message per line. `#` starts a comment line.
# `{name}` is a placeholder; write `{{` and `}}` for literal braces.
# Escapes: `\n` newline, `\\` backslash.
# Plural messages use `key.one` / `key.few` / `key.many` / `key.other`; every
# plural message must define `other`, and `{count}` is always available.
# Every key here needs a variant in `Message` (src/messages.rs).

